Scaffold a collector component package

Usage:
  eshu component init collector [flags]

Flags:
      --fact-kind string   Namespaced fact kind emitted by the scaffold
  -h, --help               help for collector
      --id string          Component ID, for example dev.example.collector.demo
      --json               Write stable JSON output
      --output string      Output directory; defaults to ./<component-id>
      --publisher string   Component publisher allowlist identity

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
